WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:28.324
Eddy and his friends were playing.

2
00:00:28.325 --> 00:00:37.670
Jeb chased Poppy.

3
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.900
Zippy zoomed by.

4
00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:51.337
"You're all slow!" he said.

5
00:00:51.338 --> 00:00:56.789
Ms. Fender came outside.

6
00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.859
"Come here, everyone!" she called.

7
00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.840
"I have some news!"

8
00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.780
Everyone hurried over.

9
00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:09.997
"What is it?" Dipper asked.

10
00:01:09.998 --> 00:01:13.906
"Field trip tomorrow!" Ms. Fender said.

11
00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.960
"Someone will do something amazing!"

12
00:01:20.891 --> 00:01:24.436
"I'll bet it's a race," Zippy said.

13
00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.460
"Someone will go fast!"

14
00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:31.870
Zippy zoomed around the parking lot.

15
00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.949
"No, Zippy," Ms. Fender said.

16
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.310
"We're not going to a race."

17
00:01:44.744 --> 00:01:49.241
"Will someone build something?" Jeb asked.

18
00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.630
"Nope," Ms. Fender said.

19
00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:56.770
"Will a car do jumps?" Gasser asked.

20
00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:59.930
"Nope," Ms. Fender said.

21
00:02:01.678 --> 00:02:05.015
"What is it then?" Eddy asked.

22
00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:08.170
"Tell us!" Poppy cried.

23
00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.210
Ms. Fender grinned.

24
00:02:11.532 --> 00:02:16.933
"Someone will say good-bye!"
